.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.env
*.pmtiles
# ...except the one the frontend ships. Vercel serves it as a static file, which is what a
# 33 MB PMTiles archive wants: edge-cached, and range requests are how PMTiles reads it.
# The batch stamp is in the filename, so replacing it on a re-bake is add-the-new,
# delete-the-old rather than an overwrite.
!web/public/tiles/*.pmtiles
*.mbtiles
